"""
DYNAMIC C6 -> C7 -> C8A EXACT SCHEDULER, 2026 Jan-Sep

Purpose
-------
1) Rebuild C5 exact baseline from the already-validated engine.
2) Calibrate the historical 60m-market metric convention against the known
   completed C6 direct-target audit:
      Jan-Aug 18 known IDs + Sep SAGA 1 known ID.
3) Run C6 dynamically inside the scheduler:
      previous same-symbol ACCEPTED trade == TP20_FULL
      entry-to-entry gap >6h and <=24h
      final-candidate daily breadth <=20
      low20 onset day 1 or 2
      symbol R24 >=15%
      symbol POS24 >=0.85
      real alt-market UP24 breadth delta vs 24h ago <= -5 percentage points
   Because previous accepted trade is read from the CURRENT scenario path,
   C6 automatically changes when C6/C7 replacements change the path.
4) Then run C7, then C8A on top:
      C7: rsi_delta<=1.5, live_gain>=0.5, gap<=1.0,
          ema9 prev1 slope>=0.3, entry/trigger jump>=0.5%.
      C8A: WATCH p_v2_score>=87.7 AND final-watch<=-3.89.
5) Output 1-9 monthly N/TP/STOP/NET and exact path/block ledgers.

Safety
------
- NO bot.py modification.
- NO DB writes.
- NO order/private endpoint.
- Public Bybit market-data reads only when an existing historical cache does
  not already cover the requested 60m data.
"""
